        <definition
          value="http://hl7.org.au/fhir/core/SearchParameter/au-core-practitionerrole-practitioner"/>
        <type value="reference"/>
        <documentation
          value="The requester **SHALL** provide at least an id value and **MAY** provide both the Type and id values.&#xa;&#xa;The responder **SHALL** support both.&#xa;&#xa;The requester **SHOULD** support chained search practitioner.identifier using a HPI-I identifier as defined in the AU PD Practitioner profile.&#xa;&#xa;The responder **SHOULD** support chained search practitioner.identifier using a HPI-I identifier as defined in the AU PD Practitioner profile."
        />
